Fix edge-weight attribute inconsistency across analysis pipeline

GraphBuilder and error models use the biological edge attribute `syn_count`,
while several weighted graph analyses only checked for the `weight`
attribute. Since FlyWire datasets do not create a `weight` edge attribute,
weighted analyses silently fell back to unweighted computation.

Updated weighted analysis modules to follow the framework convention:
prefer `syn_count`, fall back to `weight`, then `None`.

This restores correct propagation of edge weights without changing the
existing architecture or public APIs.
